# The portfolio deploys from the repository root, so anything not ignored here is public.
# Allowlist (Nov 5 audit): before this, /CLAUDE.md, /docs/, /render.yaml and the backend source were all served
# from www.contextswitch.tech. Ignore everything at the root, then re-include only what the site serves.
# A new kind of site file at the root (a new extension or folder) has to be added below, or it will 404.
/*
!/*.html
!/*.css
!/*.js
!/*.svg
!/*.png
!/*.pdf
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/vercel.json
!/api
!/assets
!/cheat-sheets
!/content
# Non-production portfolio deploys link to the State app at /implementation-context-prototype/ (site-environment.js).
!/implementation-context-prototype

# docs/ and tools/ are already excluded by /* above. These stay listed so the reasons are not lost:
# the #595 State capture trial was a review-only page that must not be publicly reachable (Paige, Nov 4),
# and the local portfolio editor (#617) runs only on Paige's Mac.
docs/review/595-state-capture-trial
tools/portfolio-editor
